    "name": "Knife (STR+1)",
    "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">In an age of powered, long-range energy weapons, the main advantage of a knife is that it is easy and cheap to manufacture, concealable, requires no power source beyond sheer physical strength, and possession is rarely regulated by planetary governments.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Model: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">Standard knife</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Type: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">Melee weapon</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Scale: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">Character</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle4\"><strong>Skill:</strong> </span><em><span class=\"fontstyle6\">Melee Combat: Knife</span></em></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Cost: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">25</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Availability: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">1</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Difficulty: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">Very Easy</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle4\">Damage: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle5\">STR +1 to STR+1D (based on type of knife) (maximum: 6D)</span> </p>",
