    "description": "<p>Heat reflective power&nbsp;armor&nbsp;was&nbsp;a type of&nbsp;armor&nbsp;worn by CompForce Assault troopers. The&nbsp;armor&nbsp;was&nbsp;white&nbsp;and&nbsp;differed&nbsp;significantly&nbsp;in&nbsp;design&nbsp;from&nbsp;standard&nbsp;Imperial&nbsp;armor&nbsp;designs&nbsp;used&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;Imperial&nbsp;Army and Navy. The&nbsp;armor&nbsp;provided minor protection against energy weapons, and greater protection against physical attacks.</p>\n<p><strong>Source:</strong> Heroes &amp; Rogues</p>",
